{"abstract":[{"text":"A mechanism in which to measure time, and delay work until a given point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in time.","type":"text"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Clock","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Duration","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Clock\/Duration","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency5ClockP8DurationQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"> : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Sendable","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Sendable","preciseIdentifier":"s:s8SendableP","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Types that conform to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"Clock","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" protocol define a concept of “now” which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is the specific instant in time that property is accessed. Any pair of calls","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"now","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property may have a minimum duration between them - this","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"minimum resolution is exposed by the ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumResolution","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property to inform"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"any user of the type the expected granularity of accuracy.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"One of the primary uses for clocks is to schedule task sleeping. This method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"resumes the calling task after a given deadline has been met or passed with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"a given tolerance value. The tolerance is